  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the broader programme, WFD will be involved in three elements: Cost of Politics research (Pillar 1); Accountability Hubs (Pillar 2, cluster 3); and Democracy Schools (Pillar 2, cluster 4). A mixture of online discussion and coaching with young people, in person support to develop projects or explore issues of democracy, and undertaking Cost of Politics research and publications. Mostly in Africa.</narrative>
